  "utterances": [
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 0.4,
      "end": 2.43,
      "text": "Fenwright HVAC, this is Lena."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 3.48,
      "end": 11.21,
      "text": "Hi Lena, it's Sam from Vantrellis. I saw your team finished the Harlow Street job last week. How did that land?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 11.64,
      "end": 16.59,
      "text": "Ha, it was a sprint, but we got there. Thanks for asking."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 17.35,
      "end": 22.49,
      "text": "Today I'll walk you through how we work and then show you the product."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 23.62,
      "end": 23.98,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 25.04,
      "end": 31.66,
      "text": "Most teams we talk to struggle with time tracking, so let me show you how we fix that."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 32.43,
      "end": 33.63,
      "text": "Okay, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 33.99,
      "end": 38.01,
      "text": "What would success look like by the end of the quarter?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 38.5,
      "end": 44.29,
      "text": "Get time tracking down to a two hour month end, and zero missed timesheets."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 45.3,
      "end": 46.73,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 47.62,
      "end": 47.99,
      "text": "Yeah."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 48.36,
      "end": 57.56,
      "text": "Our platform helps teams like yours schedule faster and keep everyone updated. It has mobile alerts, reporting, and integrations with the tools you already use."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 58.46,
      "end": 61.33,
      "text": "Okay. What does something like that cost?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 62.01,
      "end": 71.96,
      "text": "It's thirty thousand dollars a year. But honestly, if you sign this month I can take twenty percent off, so it's really a lot less than that."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 72.86,
      "end": 75.73,
      "text": "Okay. I'll have to think about it."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 76.11,
      "end": 80.13,
      "text": "Does what you've seen so far make sense for your team?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 81.28,
      "end": 86.23,
      "text": "Can you just send me some info and I'll look it over?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 86.81,
      "end": 92.69,
      "text": "Well, honestly, the info won't show you much. We're actually cheaper than most of the market."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 93.62,
      "end": 95.23,
      "text": "Okay. Send it anyway."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 96.25,
      "end": 101.39,
      "text": "I'll send over some info and you can let me know what you think."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 101.83,
      "end": 102.61,
      "text": "Sounds good."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 103.51,
      "end": 105.69,
      "text": "Thanks Lena, really appreciate the time."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 106.39,
      "end": 107.17,
      "text": "Thanks, bye."
    }
